     *
     * <p>The method configures the {@link XMLInputFactory} to:
     * <ul>
     *   <li>Disable DTD support ({@link XMLInputFactory#SUPPORT_DTD})</li>
     *   <li>Prevent resolution of external entities ({@link XMLInputFactory#IS_SUPPORTING_EXTERNAL_ENTITIES})</li>
